activity Report Disease Outbreak
activity Verify Outbreak Report
activity Initiate Investigation
activity Collect Samples
activity Analyze Samples
activity Confirm Disease
activity Implement Control Measures
activity Inform Public
activity Monitor Disease Spread
activity Declare End of Outbreak
bind Report Disease Outbreak: Report Source, Number of Cases
bind Verify Outbreak Report: Investigation Result
bind Confirm Disease: Disease Type, Mortality Rate
bind Implement Control Measures: Control Measures, Days to Control
bind Inform Public: Public Response
Report Source: Hospital, Clinic, Public, Other
Number of Cases: integer between 1 and 1000
Investigation Result: Confirmed, False Alarm, Inconclusive
Disease Type: Influenza, COVID-19, Measles, Cholera
Mortality Rate: float between 0.0 and 100.0
Control Measures: Vaccination, Quarantine, Hygiene Campaign, Social Distancing
Days to Control: integer between 1 and 365
Public Response: Cooperative, Anxious, Resistant
Init[Report Disease Outbreak] | |
Response[Report Disease Outbreak, Verify Outbreak Report] | | |
Response[Verify Outbreak Report, Initiate Investigation] |A.Investigation Result is Confirmed | |
Response[Collect Samples, Analyze Samples] | | |0,48,h
Precedence[Confirm Disease, Analyze Samples] | | |
Succession[Confirm Disease, Implement Control Measures] | | |
Response[Implement Control Measures, Inform Public] | | |
Succession[Inform Public, Monitor Disease Spread] | | |
End[Declare End of Outbreak] | |
Response[Report Disease Outbreak, Implement Control Measures] |A.Number of Cases > 500 | |0,24,h